  "remoteConnect.autoConnectTitleEligible": "Connect this project by itself on launch and when you switch to it. It never asks for anything: it goes straight in when the host is reachable, and brings the VPN up only when it isn't. Note that bringing the VPN up reroutes this whole computer's traffic — with auto-connect that happens without a prompt, so watch the header's VPN indicator.",
